<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Arduin of Ivrea</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">c. 955–1015</span> · <a href="/centuries/10th-century">10th century</a> · Of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/anscarids">Anscarids</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Arduin of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ivrea">Ivrea</a> was margrave of Ivrea in north-western <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italy">Italy</a> who was elected King of Italy by Italian nobles in 1002, after the death of Emperor Otto III. Opposed by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bishop">bishops</a> and by the German king Henry II, he held out until 1014, when he abdicated and retired to a monastery. He was the last native king of Italy before the 19th century.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/arduin-of-ivrea.jpg" alt="Arduin of Ivrea" width="320" height="427" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Davide Papalini · CC BY-SA 3.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ivrea-duomo-targa_Arduino.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote><b>Arduin of Ivrea</b> was the last native king (1002–1014).</blockquote><a href="/state/kingdom-of-italy-medieval">Kingdom of Italy (medieval)</a></li><li><blockquote>A later margrave, <b>Arduin</b>, was elected king in 1002 in opposition to the German emperor Henry II.</blockquote><a href="/state/march-of-ivrea">March of Ivrea</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in Pombia, in what is now <a href="/countries/italy">Italy</a>. Died in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/fruttuaria-abbey">Fruttuaria</a>, in what is now <a href="/countries/italy">Italy</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=45.65,8.63&amp;year=994" aria-label="Pombia on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="4755 554 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of Arduin of Ivrea"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M5205 824h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M5205 824h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=45.65,8.63&amp;year=994">What was here in 994 CE? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
